Package: leaderstweets
Type: Package
Title: Access the Executive Social Media Database
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Juan", "Gomez Cruces", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "juansalvadorgc@gmail.com")
Description: Programmatic access to the Executive Social Media Database, a
    collection of 327,900 tweets and their engagement metrics from 38 heads of
    government and state across 22 countries between 2010 and 2023. Tables are
    downloaded from the project's latest GitHub release and cached locally, so
    a new data release is picked up without updating this package. The function
    names and arguments mirror the companion Python package 'leaders_tweets'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/juangomezcruces/Executive-Social-Media-Database
BugReports: https://github.com/juangomezcruces/Executive-Social-Media-Database/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    rappdirs,
    readr,
    tibble
